# Project identity

Use the Civica artwork to identify the theme project, this documentation site and promotional material. Do not put it inside a household or business interface. People can keep a plain title or use their own name, crest or logo. See [Personalise your home](../get-started/personalisation.html).

The project and repository are named Civica. This page keeps its earlier URL for existing links.


## Project identity and interface styles

Treat [colour](colour.html), [typography](typography.html), [data](brand-data.html) and [illustration](illustration.html) as interface guidance. This page covers supplied Civica artwork only when it identifies or promotes the project.


